      "statement": "PPH v2 lifecycle states exposed on the events (RECEIVED, VALIDATING, SCREENING, HELD, REPAIR, FUNDS_CONTROL, WAREHOUSED, RELEASED, SENT_TO_NETWORK, NETWORK_ACCEPTED, NETWORK_REJECTED, COMPLETED, CANCELLED, RETURNED) are collapsed in the legacy v1 status field, which maps RELEASED, SENT_TO_NETWORK, NETWORK_ACCEPTED and COMPLETED into a single PROCESSED value.",
